{
  "name": "Drive → Shopify Image Sync",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Drive → Shopify Image Sync\n\n**Two-phase architecture (no nested loops):**\n\n**Phase 1 → Collect** (Iterate Sheets loop)\n`Load Sheet Names → Iterate Sheets → Read Sheet Rows → Collect to Static Data`\nReads all 19 sheets one at a time using the dedicated Google Sheets node.\nFiltered product rows are accumulated in workflow static data.\n\n**Phase 2 → Process** (Iterate Products loop)\n`Get Collected Products → Iterate Products → Drive lookups → Upload → Update Sheet`\nStarts only after Phase 1 finishes. Processes the flat list of products one at a time.\n\n**Image naming (case-insensitive before extension):**\n- Filename ending `-P` → IMAGE URL1 + Picture column\n- Filename ending `-S` → IMAGE URL2\n- All others → IMAGE URL3, IMAGE URL4 …\n\n**Setup:** Connect Google Drive OAuth2 and Shopify OAuth2 credentials.\nGoogle Sheets (`Template_control`) is already wired.",
        "height": 784,
        "width": 620
      },
      "id": "85d3feff-1109-4280-9576-3ce816216ee5",
      "name": "README",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
